      "transcript_text": "Just asthma.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:10",
      "end_timestamp": "01:11",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let me take your numbers. Pulse 82, blood pressure 124 over 80, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 16.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:22",
      "end_timestamp": "01:34",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't say without an X-ray. But with this kind of fall and pain on the thumb side, I think it's possibly a fracture of the wrist.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:08",
      "end_timestamp": "02:23",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I understand. The X-ray will answer the question quickly. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the wrist, today.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:34",
      "end_timestamp": "02:45",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Keep it elevated on a pillow, and use a cold pack wrapped in a cloth for twenty minutes at a time.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:10",
      "end_timestamp": "03:21",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Don't use the hand to lift anything. A sling would help for a few hours.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:29",
      "end_timestamp": "03:37",
